{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为至少星期日让樱乃多睡一会的想法，我一个人出门前往社团。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "睡眠不足是女孩子的大敌。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不过樱乃实在太常在我房间爆睡，应该是不用担心啦。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有时我以为她在我房里看书，没想到一转头就在床上睡着了。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "更不用说现在这个季节真的很好睡了。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘎！？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0827", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……早安，乾同学。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然她的第一反应是那样，我还是打了招呼。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "打从心底讨厌的表情。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一大早就糟透了。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0828", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉让你不开心了。”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是说了今天休息吗？为什么你一副要去社团的样子啊？”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0829", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为有点在意动物们。而且今天美羽学姐也要打工吧。”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐的打工是从下午开始。我想说上午可以跟她亲亲热热的说。”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0830", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以她看到我才这么不爽啊。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不对，乾同学是随时都在对我不爽。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，能像这样并肩行走已经算稍有进步了吧。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且今天……”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0831", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？今天怎么了吗？”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0832", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一天，我们野放了２只松鼠回归大自然。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们社团的目的并不是饲育动物。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而是救助动物让它们恢复建康，并且回到原本的生活环境。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉喔，让你们在这么狭窄的笼子待了这么久。”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "mu0773", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不可以再回来这里啰……”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "mu0774", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这两只松鼠是受伤躺在路边时被学姐捡到的。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "它们身旁的松鼠妈妈已经死去。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今后它们必须自己面对严酷的大自然。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有人能帮助它们。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，那里也有着无尽的自由。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0833", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和带着笑容目送松鼠们的美羽学姐相比，乾同学正拼命忍住眼泪。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她平常就很照顾两只松鼠，它们也很亲近她。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“乾同学，请用。”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我递出手帕，乾同学立刻背对我。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是她拿走了手帕。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“走吧，回去吧。”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "mu0775", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那两只松鼠没有取名字。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是美羽学姐决定的，为了不要产生感情。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“快点走啦，混张家伙……”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0834", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学依然背对着，很有她风格地送别松鼠们。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是２只松鼠就像赛跑一样，一下子就消失在森林中。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学的肩膀在颤抖。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她们两人已经经历过多少次这样的离别了呢？", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐没有对乾同学说什么安慰的话。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是轻轻摸了摸她的头。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那个，学姐不会寂寞吗？”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然会寂寞啊。”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "mu0776", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的笑容没有变。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，因为那些孩子比我更寂寞。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "mu0777", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐温柔地看了一眼松鼠们消失的森林。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有人称赞。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "动物们也没有像童话或传说那样回来报恩。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是学姐依然挺直娇小的背脊，守护着森林。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊，这是谁的手帕？”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0835", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是我的……可是，刚才不是你自己接下的吗？”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……完全不记得。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0836", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是她整个心都在想松鼠的事情而已。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你应该没有在上厕所后用这条手帕吧？”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0837", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“放心，没有用。”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你居然上完厕所不会洗手吗！？”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0838", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是那个意思啦！我是说我今天还没有去过厕所。”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉你身上有一大堆奇怪的病菌，这条手帕也消毒一下比较好。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0839", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说完后，乾同学把我的手帕放进自己的包包中。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，我的手帕……”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“消毒后再还你。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0840", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉喔。我原本也想借手帕给小纱凪的，可以刚才洗手后用过了……”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "mu0778", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么！！！？唔……想要。美羽学姐的含汁手帕！”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0841", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "含什么汁液啊……", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～？”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 373, "voice": "pn0307", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵也想要对吧？美羽学姐的含汁手帕。简称为美羽汁……啊啊啊、多么高尚的发音！”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0842", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "简略错地方了吧？", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿咻。这个笼子也得清洗干净才行呢。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "mu0779", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，那种杂务就交给我吧。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0843", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来，瓜生，你也不要再发呆了！”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0844", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着没有松鼠的笼子，乾同学强打起精神。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这就是她的行事风格吧。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“希望有一天，这里的动物都会离开呢。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。为了这个目标我也要努力才行。”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "mu0780", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "培养出感情的动物离去当然很寂寞。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但那并不是悲伤的事。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然寂寞，但也是非常美好的事。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生，我要锁门了快点出来！”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0845", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，抱歉抱歉，我在传邮件给樱乃。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种事待会再做啦，快点，我要锁门了。”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0846", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我像个积欠房租的住户一样被她赶出来。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃发来的邮件只有主旨，没有内文。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“完全被你下套了，哥哥。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": "_sk5164", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来她很不开心我没叫醒她就出门这件事。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还是回复她吧。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近也发现她受到安洁影响，在这个多愁善感的年纪身为哥哥实在有点担心。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果是受到乾同学的影响的话……", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘我老哥超烦人的欸！’", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": "sk1205", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或许还会在房间里看漫画时突然飞踢我。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……可以的话，我希望她能受到美羽学姐的影响。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉……为什么我要跟你一起回去啊。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0847", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为美羽学姐去打工了，所以社团只剩下我们。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "走出校门时还被安洁起哄了几句，这也是造成她不爽的原因之一。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁当时笑着说。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是恩爱夫妻呢”之类的话。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……对了，你的手没事了吗？”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0848", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“手？”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“之前不是烧伤了？”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0849", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，没事喔，而且原本就没有很严重。”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0850", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么短的时间发生了很多事呢。”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在你入社之前都很和平。”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0851", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，的确。如果没有我，乾同学就不会在社团教室里飞踢了吧。”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那种事哪可能再做第二次。”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0852", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学一脚踢起小石子，脸颊气鼓鼓的。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我们并肩行走，不过还是保持着生疏的距离。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“先说清楚，我可还没有认可你是社员喔。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0853", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要怎么做你才愿意认可？”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只要你变成女生，或是再也不靠近美羽学姐半径１０米以内就可以。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0854", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两个都不可能啦。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果办不到的话……”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0855", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇！？”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学突然甩动手上提着的包包。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就尽全力让我认可试试吧，笨蛋！”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 379, "voice": "sn0856", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学对我吐舌，然后转身跑走了。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连说再见的时间都不留给我。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过比起之前，或许稍微有进步了吧。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔，樱乃传了邮件。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是刚才那封邮件的回复吧。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她还是一样传了只写主旨的邮件。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的头痛起来了……", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
